  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">A decline in chokepoint_access (more closures/diversions or denial risks) prompts firms and states to accelerate onshoring and build alternative logistics and production (data centers, fabs), driving increased capital commitments into AI compute and related infrastructure.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_iran_confront</data>
