  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A reduction and unpredictability in tanker transits raises freight and insurance cost swings and creates erratic arrival schedules for distillates and crude into European and regional hubs, directly increasing short‑term volatility in regional energy and fuel prices.</data>
