  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">An increase in military operational tempo raises geopolitical tail-risk and investor risk aversion, driving flight-to-quality into safe-haven sovereign bonds and pushing benchmark yields down.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_iran_confront</data>
