  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">An uptick in US–Iran kinetic operations draws US/NATO ISR, air-defence and diplomatic bandwidth toward the Middle East, reducing real-time intelligence, warning and political constraining of Russian operations and thereby enabling Moscow to increase the rate and severity of strikes against Ukrainian infrastructure.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
