  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher rates of drone strikes that damage port terminals, logistics hubs, or manufacturing adjacent infrastructure cause localized interruptions and delays in shipments of wafers, packaged ICs and memory, tightening short‑term chip and memory availability.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">maritime_chokepoints</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
