  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Tightness in semiconductor and memory supplies delays delivery of control-system replacements and spare parts for gas compressors, grid controllers and refinery PLCs, reducing operational availability of energy and transport infrastructure.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_energy</data>
