  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Shortages of advanced chips and MEMS caused by export controls and supply-chain disruption undermine production and repair of guided munitions and loitering munitions, lowering Russia's ability to mount high-tempo precision strikes.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
