  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Sustained appreciation of the dollar (or depreciation of other major currencies) raises the local‑currency cost of cross‑border investments, causing foreign investors to pull back from diversified international compute projects and concentrate capital into a smaller set of domestic or home‑market technology champions.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_monetary_stress</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
</edge>
