  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A rise in targeted strikes on energy and transport infrastructure increases perceived geopolitical vulnerability of cross‑border compute and data infrastructure, prompting governments and strategic investors to accelerate and direct new capital into domestic/ally AI compute projects as a resilience priority.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_energy</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
</edge>
