  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.55</data>
  <data key="d37">Sustained high-intensity strikes on coastal export terminals and logistics nodes redirect commercial energy traffic onto longer routes that traverse Iranian-contested waters, increasing incidents and lowering overall maritime security.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_energy</data>
