  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Sustained regional fuel shortfalls drive closer energy and strategic coordination between Russia and importing states (including deeper energy/industrial ties with China), provoking U.S. countermeasures and export controls that raise bilateral technology and supply‑chain tensions.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_energy</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
